  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please consider an invite function where only those in the room could invite their friends but be labelled by the one who invited them. This, I feel could prevent players from feeling alienated when the friends send each other requests to join. So it's a selective process, and not like a friends plus that automatically has players join. The current invite private room alienates people if the room owner is afk. Also, if there is a problematic individual, others can know who invited them, and others can choose to discuss the invited person who caused the issue with the invitee privately. With this as a new added feature, I feel that population growth is more easily possible for VRC users.",
